  "word_count": 179,
  "body_markdown": "Hackensack, NJ\n\nAbout\n\nAbout UsDr. Alan MeskinDr. Maurice SrourDr. Won-Sang LeeDr. Dmitriy KlassOur TechnologyOffice Gallery\n\nServices\n\nAll ServicesDental ImplantsSingle Tooth ImplantsAll-On-XSmile MakeoversFull Mouth RehabilitationImplant BridgeImplant RevisionEmergency Dental ServicesSedation DentistryCost of Dental ImplantsDental Implant FAQs\n\nPatient Stories\n\nPatient TestimonialsBefore & After\n\nNew Patient\n\nYour First VisitInsurance & FinancingDental Implant FAQsPre Op & Post Op InstructionsBlogs\n\nDoctor Referral\n\nContact\n\nSchedule Your Consultation\n\nSCHEDULE FREE CONSULTATION\n\nSchedule Consultation\n\n\n# Patient Testimonials\n\n\nAt Hackensack Center for Dental Implants, led by prosthodontist, Dr. Alan Meskin, our patients are the best measure of our work. We focus on doing one thing exceptionally well, replacing and restoring teeth, and on treating every person with the care and honesty we would want ourselves. The stories below are theirs, in their own words.\n\n\n## Patient Testimonials\n\n\n\n### Reimagine your dental experience\n\n\n\n### address\n\n\n163 Main Street, Suite A1,\n\nHackensack, NJ 07601\n\n(551) 368-2476\n\n\n### Hours\n\n\nMonday - Friday: 10:00 AM to 6:00 PM\n\nSaturday - Sunday: Closed\n\n\n### LANGUAGES\n\n\nEnglish\n\nEspañol\n\nРусский\n\nPortuguese\n\nKorean\n\nServing Hackensack and the Greater Bergen County Area\n\nCopyright © 2026 Hackensack Center for Dental Implants\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nTerms of Service\n\nCookie Policy\n\nHIPAA Disclosure",
